        "result": "Fetched 43484 bytes, SHA-256 8cdb688380c543c1bd3bc47e2124ec6872511eff8c03c8340b1adacdbd1525fe. Current-method P60-287 Table B-2 values are 2019 12.6%, 2020 9.7%, 2021 5.2%, 2022 12.4%, 2023 13.7%, and 2024 13.4%; every parser check returned error=None."
